OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd light shower will be
OL,6,Fpossible at first, most likely for
OL,7,FShetland. Otherwise it will be a dry
OL,8,Fday with bright or sunny spells and
OL,9,Flight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will stay dry through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with clear
OL,13,Fspells. Light winds in the evening
OL,14,Fbecoming fresh south to
OL,15,Fsoutheasterlies overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA dry and bright but breezy
OL,18,Fstart. Becoming cloudy through the
OL,19,Fafternoon with a little light rain,
OL,20,Fand with strengthening south to
OL,21,Fsoutheast winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
